{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54932","headline":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 三十八 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 三十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹅与鸭，或解（京本作「忽辨」）作人声。\n家内必登三品禄（京本作「位」），一门子（辛本、川本作「儿」）侄尽（京本作「更」）享（辛本、川本、京本作「亨」）荣，吉兆自天生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54932.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54932","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}